  "prefLabel": "He-E 806.37 Reimbursement for Out-of-State Nursing Care",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-E 806.37 Reimbursement for Out-of-State Nursing Care. Reimbursement for out-of-state nursing care shall be made as follows:\n\n(a) The department shall base the reimbursement rate on the rate set by the medicaid agency of the state in which the out-of-state NF is located for services at that NF; and\n\n(b) In cases where the out-of-state medicaid rate does not exist or is not sufficient to allow access of New Hampshire residents in need of services, a rate shall be determined by the department as described in He-E 806.\n\nSource. #8547, eff 1-24-06 (formerly He-W 593.39); ss by #10474, 1-24-14; ss by #14020, eff 7-10-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-e800.html"
